<title>FRANCE: French broker upgrades Suez - sources.</title>
<headline>French broker upgrades Suez - sources.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>French brokerage Delahaye has upgraded Cie Financiere Suez to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;neutral,&quot; market sources said.</p>
<p>They said the upgrade was made on the basis of a number of &quot;technical and strategic points&quot; but gave no details.</p>
<p>The stock was up 1.20 francs at 164.70, or 0.65 percent at 1527 GMT, while the wider market was down 0.01 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
